    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">al-luctor</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adl-</span></b> ), āri, v. dep.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to struggle
			with</i> or <i>against</i> (only in App.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dein adluctari et etiam saltare (me) perdocuit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 10, p. 247</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adluctantem mihi saevissimam fortunam
					superāram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 11</span></i>
			.</div>
